  <entity00159023:NonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalyzeForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalyzeForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">11039081000000</entity00159023:NonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalyzeForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfMaturityAnalyzeForNonDerivativeFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
